@startuml
title UC-ED-001 提交采编协同需求 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "采编成员" as A
boundary "接口:普通成员接口" as B
control "控制:提交采编协同需求控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "E:采编协同" as E
participant "W:作品" as W
A -> B: 提交采编协同需求(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 提交采编协同需求(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> E: 建立协同(来源成员、作品、平台、可选期限)
activate E
E -> W: 验证来源(材料、原创或转载)
W --> E: 来源验证结果
E --> C: 待派发协同或信息不合法原因
deactivate E

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
